            "colorClass": "amber",
            "value": "—"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.A — Area between curves",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the area between \\( y=x \\) and \\( y=x^2 \\) on \\( [0,1] \\).</p><p>Here \\( x\\geq x^2 \\) on \\( [0,1] \\), so integrate the difference:</p>\\[ \\int_0^1 \\big(x-x^2\\big)\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{x^2}{2}-\\tfrac{x^3}{3}\\Big]_0^1=\\tfrac12-\\tfrac13=\\tfrac16. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.B — Volume of revolution",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>The region under \\( y=\\sqrt{x} \\) on \\( [0,4] \\) is revolved about the \\( x \\)-axis. Find the volume.</p><p>Disk method with \\( R(x)=\\sqrt{x} \\), so \\( R^2=x \\):</p>\\[ V=\\pi\\int_0^4 x\\,dx=\\pi\\Big[\\tfrac{x^2}{2}\\Big]_0^4=8\\pi. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Geometric and physical applications",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Definite integrals compute areas between curves, volumes of solids of revolution, arc lengths, and work done by variable forces.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Area between curves",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\int_a^b[f(x)-g(x)]\\,dx \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Disk method",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( V=\\pi\\int_a^b[f(x)]^2\\,dx \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Shell method",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( V=2\\pi\\int_a^b x\\,f(x)\\,dx \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Arc length",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( L=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{1+[f'(x)]^2}\\,dx \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example — area",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the area between \\( y=x^2 \\) and \\( y=x \\) from \\( x=0 \\) to \\( x=1 \\).</p>\\[ \\int_0^1(x-x^2)\\,dx = \\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^1 = \\frac{1}{6}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example — disk volume",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the volume when \\( y=\\sqrt{x} \\) on \\( [0,4] \\) is revolved about the \\( x \\)-axis.</p>\\[ V=\\pi\\int_0^4 x\\,dx = \\pi\\cdot 8 = 8\\pi. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
